{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8b8d6006945d280a252","chatId":"e1ad98dbaf9240aa9df40398c70f0a70","sessionId":null,"userId":68510,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1039,"promptTokens":1608,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:00"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068775584023049,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8b8d6006945d280a250","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369720616,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8b8d6006945d280a250","chatId":"e1ad98dbaf9240aa9df40398c70f0a70","sessionId":null,"userId":68510,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n来自美国的路西在访问中国期间，被她的新中国同事凌邀请去与朋友们共进晚餐。点餐时，凌为整张桌子点了菜，直接就还了菜单，没让路西看。食物上桌后，路西看着菜肴，然后说：“我可以吃这个”，选了一个菜吃。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，凌最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 气恼 & 伤心\nB) 没意识的 & 反对\nC) 开心 & 嫉妒\nD) 反对 & 嫉妒\nE) 没意识的 & 伤心\nF) 没意识的 & 开心\n\n## 问题 2\n凌为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她不知道美国人喜欢自己点餐 & 露西亚没有为晚餐道谢\nB) 路西自己拿了一道菜，而所有的菜都应该是大家一起分的 & 她原本期待露西亚会用中文说话\nC) 她不知道美国人喜欢自己点餐 & 路西自己拿了一道菜，而所有的菜都应该是大家一起分的\nD) 路西自己拿了一道菜，而所有的菜都应该是大家一起分的 & 她认为露西亚不喜欢中国食物\nE) 她不知道美国人喜欢自己点餐 & 她原本期待露西亚会用中文说话\nF) 她不知道美国人喜欢自己点餐 & 露西亚没有询问凌关于食物选择，所以凌觉得被忽视了","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068775584023049,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8b8d6006945d280a252","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369720613,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e2e2a11e9eb2405c842ddf1b68ef0581"}